<title>USA: Armor Holdings names Watson CFO.</title>
<headline>Armor Holdings names Watson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armor Holdings Inc Wednesday named David W. Watson as chief financial officer, effective August 25.</p>
<p>Watson was formerly vice president - finance of TT Group Industries Inc, a subsidiary of an unidentified United Kingdom conglomerate, Armor said in a statement.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not available for comment.</p>
</text>
